2. Top Predicted Classes

Selected time-window class counts

WITH bounds AS (
    SELECT
        $__timeFrom()::date AS start_date,
        $__timeTo()::date AS end_date
),
class_counts AS (
    SELECT
        class_label,
        SUM(prediction_count) AS prediction_count
    FROM public.ewoc_ticket_prediction_health h
    CROSS JOIN bounds b
    WHERE h.record_type = 'DAILY_CLASS_METRIC'
      AND h.metric_date BETWEEN b.start_date AND b.end_date
    GROUP BY class_label
),
total AS (
    SELECT
        SUM(prediction_count) AS total_predictions
    FROM class_counts
)
SELECT
    c.class_label,
    c.prediction_count,
    ROUND(
        100.0 * c.prediction_count
        / NULLIF(t.total_predictions, 0),
        2
    ) AS prediction_pct
FROM class_counts c
CROSS JOIN total t
ORDER BY c.prediction_count DESC
LIMIT 8;

Grafana:

Title: Top Predicted Classes
Y/category: class_label
Bar value: prediction_count
Tooltip: prediction_pct

If selected range changes:

1 day  → counts only that day
2 days → sum of those 2 days
7 days → sum of those 7 days
30 days → sum of those 30 days

Do not average prediction_pct. The query correctly recalculates the percentage after summing counts.

