This is preferable to continuing to label it Current Week vs Reference, because once users zoom to two days it is no longer a “week.”

The important part to tell the Grafana team

For these four panels:

Do NOT use run_id filtering.
Use metric_date and the Grafana selected date range.
Do NOT average per-day F1, Recall, Precision, or percentages.
Aggregate underlying counts and recompute the metric.
For label-based metrics, prefer DAILY_* trusted rows over
DAILY_*_PROVISIONAL for any date where trusted data exists.

That last point is especially important. Otherwise a date that exists in both trusted and provisional data can be counted twice.